7,8 $ Truffle interior with rounded to slightly elongate or irregular chambers
8,cs4 $ Truffle flesh soft, white to yellow or brown $ Basidiomycetes$s"Basidiomycete"
8,cs5 $ Truffle flesh firm to crisp, gray to brown or purple $ Ascomycetes$s"Ascomycete"

